"neo/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:18
#: c159bb7f482f4e388b95f1ee200a6a4d
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:20
#: 4abcb1ed4ac44f0598a5835bdfe31214
msgid "The sensor can be connected to any autopilot serial port."
msgstr "该传感器可连接到飞控的任意串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:26
#: f7b18a367ffe4c25a1ca6332d0375692
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:28
#: 32822ba179d54d92b3b3f7ff0c6b8881
msgid ""
"For the below example, we will assume that the rangefinder is connected to "
"SERIAL2 as the first system rangefinder:"
msgstr "以下示例假设测距仪连接至 SERIAL2，作为系统第一个测距仪："

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:30
#: d78d0a40a49c48ba88751e2c146ac2c5
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` =  9 (Rangefinders)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（测距仪）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:31
#: 6f02994322c14fba923f91f31be9ebe8
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD<SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 9 (9600 Baud)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD<SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 9（9600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:32
#: a6646b9849dc47c48b865f30caa6b30a
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 35 (TeraRanger NEO)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 35（TeraRanger NEO）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:35
#: 057ab2a80aad4496a4dee79f9d4eda9f
msgid "As a Plane altitude rangefinder used in auto landings:"
msgstr "用于 Plane 自动降落时的高度测距仪："

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:37
#: afc01986ef2f412daf524f92c43f322a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` bits 0 or 1 to enable used of the "
"rangefinder during landing phases of Plane and QuadPlane. The first "
"rangefinder with \"down\" orientation will be used."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` 的第 0 位或第 1 位置 1，以在 Plane 和 QuadPlane"
" 降落阶段启用测距仪。将使用方向朝下的第一个测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:39
#: e6c0e967a1a84d2ea8e58d4738a046a6
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (down)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（朝下）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:40
#: 25febb4ce0b64a52b24c7fabe906b5fe
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5 (meters)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5（米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:41
#: ca508c3455da48cca189ac9434adfa76
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 22 (22m since grass landings will "
"reduce reliable range down to this range instead of 30m)"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 22（22 米，因在草地降落会将可靠测距范围降至该值，而非 30 米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:47
#: 5364e7bc4f3c4f30ad0c7a5d6c8f5bd6
msgid ""
"For Copter and Object Avoidance applications, additional/different "
"parameters will be need to set. See :ref:`common-rangefinder-setup`."
msgstr "对于 Copter 及避障应用，还需要设置额外或不同的参数。请参阅 :ref:`common-rangefinder-setup`。"
